# the official opam index when this floor landed. All four packages come from
# one release and constrain one another to the exact version, so pin the whole
# set to the peeled v2.3.0 commit. Remove these pins once 2.3.0 is indexed; keep
# the >= 2.3.0 dependency floors in dune-project.
